# Project workflow

- Follow AGENTS.md and the setup/run/test instructions in README.md and VALIDATION.md.
- Keep frontend assets local, touch controls usable, and unavailable readings honest. Do not introduce demo sensor values into the live app.
- Preserve screen-level desk-display compositions, bold type, the floating dock, and full-screen clock/artwork. Detailed settings belong in More; the user explicitly rejected sidebar/card-grid dashboard styling.
- Use dashboard port 18761 and certificate setup port 18760. Preserve silent startup in the user's desktop session.
- Avoid restarting the active server for static edits. Use scripts/restart-server.ps1 when a backend restart is necessary.
- Test changed behavior and document actual verification; never claim an unperformed reboot or physical control test passed.
- Keep user-facing how-tos aligned with the UI, particularly Device access for approving and revoking browsers.
- Commit source, project rules, and documentation; exclude generated local state and secrets. Push completed work to the existing repository without rewriting history.
